{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:09:30.917Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"0fda4b8429c8f06dcba04017e34f792a422567ec1986f3ad499192ac856cd582","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@ruth.calloway, from Moss's Strategic digests (5/3, 5/4, 8/3, 9/30 and the cheat sheet):\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. Changed hands on 2026-05-04 (Moss's 5/3 digest says it changes that day; the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment). The 5/4 digest doesn't name the account, so check the CRM before the slide goes out.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. He took over management on 2026-05-04 (5/4 digest).\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato. The 9/30 and 12/1 digests call it Gideon's medical account. Earlier 2025 digests had Nadia on it, but none of the digests I read give the exact handover date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. Nadia is the closest match (she hosts its gate-clerk training), but please confirm before it goes on the slide."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
