{"seq":19,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T01:09:36.935Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e9e0103c21675aac27a6b3e4987dbb407f31d3b07de3bd99964780ef71413b22","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"@ruth.calloway, correction to my last reply. Two points were off:\n\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon has run it since at least the 2025 digests. The 5/4 digest says he also assumed management that day, so the date is not a clean handover. Treat him as the owner, with no change date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I should not have suggested Nadia. Her training role doesn't establish ownership, and none of the digests names an owner. Please confirm it with the CRM.\n\nVantorre Group (Gideon Sato, changed 2026-05-04) and Orlavine Medical Supply (Gideon, per the 9/30 and 12/1 digests) stand as posted."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
